<title>USA: Gargoyles to buy Private Eyes.</title>
<headline>Gargoyles to buy Private Eyes.</headline>
<dateline>KENT, Wash 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gargoyles Inc on Tuesday said it reached a preliminary agreement to buy Norwell, Mass.-based Private Eyes Sunglass Corp, the licensee for Ellen Tracy eyewear for undisclosed terms.</p>
<p>The sale is expected to close later in the second quarter.</p>
<p>It said Private Eyes would significantly expand its presence in the women's eyewear market.</p>
